title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg

= Rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of <span style="color: #C00000;">social democratic</span> life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @class_struggle: The class struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
- @welfare: Sozialpolitik - the maintenance and expansion of social welfare programs.
- @democracy: Expanding our democracy and defending it against dictatorship.
- @pacifism: Opposing war and supporting rapprochement with the east
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: workers_spd += 0.5*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 0.5*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; new_left_strength += 5; new_left_dissent -= 5; self_employed_spd -= 0.4; white_collar_workers_spd -= 0.2;

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while potentially alienating the middle class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_spd += 0.5*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 0.5*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; trade_unionist_strength += 5; trade_unionist_dissent -= 5;

The message appeals to the organized workers, whose benefits are the accomplishments of <span style="color: #C00000;">social democracy</span>. [? if welfare > 1 : Our achievements in expanding welfare have made this message more effective. ?]

@democracy
on-arrival: pro_republic += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 0.3*(1-dissent); white_collar_workers_spd += 0.3*(1-dissent)

Our speakers defend the republican system and emphasize its accomplishments.

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 0.4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; white_collar_workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3;

Our speakers build up support for a Neue Ostpolitik, normalization of relations with the eastern block and pacifism.

[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the electorate is enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@local
on-arrival: workers_spd += 0.6*(1-dissent); white_collar_workers_spd += 0.6*(1-dissent); self_employed_spd += 0.2*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the electorate in this moment.
